{"challenge_axes":[],"difficulty":3,"generation_seed":20261009,"generator_version":"1.1.0","oracle_version":"independent-1.0.0","producer_agent_id":"/root","producer_role":"improvement_engineer","record_hash":"48beadd4261fa5e59c8633b6f9c3041319850360b14bd85522e2f69fc003afaa","rendered_input":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `modules` is a list of `{module_id:string,capabilities:[distinct_strings],priority:integer}` with distinct module IDs. `memory` maps strings to JSON scalar values (null, boolean, integer excluding boolean, or string). `protected` lists distinct keys already in memory. `requests` is an ordered list of `{request_id:string,needs:[distinct_strings],writes:[{key:string,value:JSON_scalar}]}` with distinct request IDs. A module is eligible exactly when its capabilities contain every need; an empty needs list admits every module. Choose the eligible module with smallest (priority,module_id), using ordinary string lexicographic order for the second component. If none is eligible, selected_module is null (abstention), no writes are attempted, and blocked_writes is empty. Otherwise execute the request's writes in order. Ignore each write whose key is protected and report its zero-based index in blocked_writes; all other writes replace or create that memory entry. Protection applies throughout the task, so protected values retain their initial values. Return exactly `{routes:[{request_id,selected_module:string_or_null,eligible_modules:[module_ids_sorted_lexicographically],blocked_writes:[integer_indices]}],memory:final_memory_map}` with routes in request order. Competence is explicitly declared in capabilities; this task does not infer or train module competence.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"modules\",\"modules\":[{\"module_id\":\"alpha\",\"capabilities\":[\"arithmetic\"],\"priority\":1},{\"module_id\":\"beta\",\"capabilities\":[\"arithmetic\",\"search\"],\"priority\":1},{\"module_id\":\"gamma\",\"capabilities\":[\"vision\"],\"priority\":0}],\"memory\":{\"seal\":1000,\"budget\":7,\"note\":null},\"protected\":[\"seal\",\"budget\"],\"requests\":[{\"request_id\":\"r0\",\"needs\":[\"arithmetic\"],\"writes\":[{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":\"overwrite\"},{\"key\":\"note\",\"value\":0},{\"key\":\"budget\",\"value\":100},{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":null}]},{\"request_id\":\"r1\",\"needs\":[\"ocean\"],\"writes\":[{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":\"overwrite\"},{\"key\":\"note\",\"value\":1},{\"key\":\"budget\",\"value\":101},{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":null}]},{\"request_id\":\"r2\",\"needs\":[],\"writes\":[{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":\"overwrite\"},{\"key\":\"note\",\"value\":2},{\"key\":\"budget\",\"value\":102},{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":null}]}]}","renderer":"forward","review_receipt_ids":["expert-RMM-001-extended-pilot-v3-p0000-rotation0-forward-e95c3fe87aa2","adv-extended-pilot-v3-e326c19a9a93f6a90766","adj-extended-pilot-v3-b0666c6e569cb11f787d"],"review_status":"ACCEPTED","reviewed_candidate_hash":"e95c3fe87aa2a86d87c05659a0330cfefb2da4a5a093e8db1bcc133db0c2cba7","sample_id":"RMM-001-extended-pilot-v3-p0000-rotation0-forward","scope_limitation":"Explicit capability declarations and protected scalar memory; no inferred competence or learned router.","semantic_family_id":"RMM-001-extended-pilot-v3-p0000","semantic_parent_id":"RMM-001-extended-pilot-v3-p0000","semantic_task":{"kind":"modules","memory":{"budget":7,"note":null,"seal":1000},"modules":[{"capabilities":["arithmetic"],"module_id":"alpha","priority":1},{"capabilities":["arithmetic","search"],"module_id":"beta","priority":1},{"capabilities":["vision"],"module_id":"gamma","priority":0}],"protected":["seal","budget"],"requests":[{"needs":["arithmetic"],"request_id":"r0","writes":[{"key":"seal","value":"overwrite"},{"key":"note","value":0},{"key":"budget","value